      "say": "Protect the route to our goal before chasing wide.",
      "question": "Press or cover?"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "title": "Ball side wide, far side in",
      "say": "Give width near the ball; the far midfielder comes inside to help.",
      "question": "Stay wide or tuck in?"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "title": "One comes, one goes",
      "say": "Our two forwards shouldn't make the same run.",
      "question": "Offer feet or threaten behind?",
      "lesson": "one-comes-one-goes"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "title": "Go together, recover together",
      "say": "If one presses, others close the next pass; if beaten, recover as a unit.",
      "question": "Are teammates close enough to help?"
    }
  ],
